{"src":"tr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":201500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"tr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8614.573881,"text":"Schengen bölgesi bu anlamda az çok tek bir ülke gibi işliyor."},{"kind":"text","t":9226.058435,"text":"In this sense, the Schengen area functions more or less like a single country."},{"kind":"audio","t":9334.787032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":9338.299382000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9340.298588000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9341.496267,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":16967.142167,"text":"Mekke'nin kuzeyindeki dağların birinin tepesinde yer alan mağara, dünyanın geri kalanından tamamen izolidir."},{"kind":"text","t":17967.370775,"text":"The cave, located on the peak of one of the mountains north of Mecca, is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":18074.579247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18076.102161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18077.513847000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18078.720866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18080.312519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18081.569338,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":27870.808221,"text":"İnsanlar asla bir kalem tıraşa yaklaşmak zorunda kalmadan artık bilgisayar ekranlarından mesajlar yazıyor."},{"kind":"text","t":28635.750679,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens without ever having to come close to a pencil sharpener."},{"kind":"audio","t":28754.146991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28759.290293000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28764.237739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":28769.642267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28774.883987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":28775.743973,"samples":11360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":42650.355244,"text":"Ağır vergilendirmeye tabi ülkelere seyahat eden yolcular özellikle alkollü iç içeceklerden ve tütün mamullerinden benzer önemli ölçüde tasarruf edebilir."},{"kind":"text","t":43466.621728,"text":"Passengers traveling to countries subject to heavy taxation can save significantly, especially on alcoholic beverages and tobacco products."},{"kind":"audio","t":43592.171037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43597.30218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":43602.657928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":43607.816810000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43613.14217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43618.540828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43623.10595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43625.736415,"samples":27424,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":48854.624888,"text":"Bitkiler besinlerini güneşten fotozenitezle elde ederler. Gölgede sağlarlar."},{"kind":"text","t":49515.681547,"text":"Plants obtain their nutrients from the sun through photosynthesis. They survive in the shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":49621.67311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49626.651265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":49631.853307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49633.538948,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"audio","t":49704.705765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49707.598235,"samples":23032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":59403.791135,"text":"Hastane, diğer insanların muhtemel enfeksiyonunu önlemek için hastayı diğerlerinden tecrit etmeyip içeren bir enfeksiyon kontrol protokolü izledi."},{"kind":"text","t":60359.613949,"text":"The hospital followed an infection control protocol that did not isolate the patient from others to prevent the potential infection of other people."},{"kind":"audio","t":60477.337402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60480.493258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60483.690444,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60487.012827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60490.35664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60493.626734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60496.899339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":60497.602767000004,"samples":12424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68110.466965,"text":"Yapılan iş genelde teorikti. Fakat program Sagittarius galaksisine yönelik gözlemleri taklit etmek için yazılmıştı."},{"kind":"text","t":68725.144105,"text":"The work performed was generally theoretical. But the program was written to simulate observations directed toward the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":68834.776816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":68839.900239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68843.132254,"samples":23864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"audio","t":68924.74993199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68930.14171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68935.26293299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68940.681871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68946.21369599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":68946.55616,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":82592.333053,"text":"Barcelona'nın resmi dilleri Katalanca ve İspanyolcadır. Halkın yaklaşık yarısı Katalanca konuşmayı tercih etmekte, büyük çoğunluğu bu dili anlamakta ve neredeyse herkes İspanyolca bilmektedir."},{"kind":"text","t":83703.823534,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. About half of the population prefers to speak Catalan, the vast majority understand the language, and almost everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":83878.84344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83884.262997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":83889.65365499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83892.080464,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":84024.27196999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84029.64733899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":84034.671873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84040.00938199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84045.207503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":84050.595792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84055.35371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":84055.67196499999,"samples":1624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94232.56905899999,"text":"Bazı bölgelerde suyu bir dakika kaynatmak yeterlidir. Diğer bölgelerde ise suyun kaynaması için birkaç dakika daha gerekir."},{"kind":"text","t":95022.52444099999,"text":"In some regions, boiling the water for one minute is sufficient. In other regions, however, it takes a few more minutes for the water to boil."},{"kind":"audio","t":95124.869566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95129.997679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95135.41644599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95137.41799199999,"samples":16896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":95200.79712199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95206.021803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95211.41836099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95215.898554,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":107317.394236,"text":"Bitkiler doğal bir ortamda oldukları zaman en iyi halleriyle görünürler. Bu nedenle sadece bir örneği bile almanın cazibesine direnin."},{"kind":"text","t":107903.40700499999,"text":"Plants look their best when they are in a natural environment. Therefore, resist the temptation to take even a single example."},{"kind":"audio","t":108010.26680299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108015.73319999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108021.31850499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":108021.547071,"samples":4896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":108096.923866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108102.164546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108107.388467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":108109.415553,"samples":17496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":114391.905663,"text":"1920'lerde çoğu vatandaş ve ulusun egemen tavrı barışçılık ve izolasyondu."},{"kind":"text","t":115333.351472,"text":"In the 1920s, the dominant attitude of most citizens and nations was pacifism and isolationism."},{"kind":"audio","t":115453.92565599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115459.19240599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":115464.57624499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115469.794526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115475.12576499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115480.574472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":115480.84902699999,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126004.51184899999,"text":"Mosazor döneminin doruklarındaki yırtıcısıydı. Dolayısıyla diğer Mosazorlardan başka hiçbir şeyden korkmuyordu."},{"kind":"text","t":126745.17114199999,"text":"He was the predator at the peak of the Mosazor era. Therefore, he feared nothing other than the other Mosazors."},{"kind":"audio","t":126896.211717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126903.013111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126907.13752999999,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"audio","t":127049.66393,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127055.084118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127060.564885,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127060.896069,"samples":6096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137213.695054,"text":"Paraguay, Asensio'nun 1537'de kurulmasından bu yana yerli kimliğini ve karakterini büyük ölçüde kurmayı başardı."},{"kind":"text","t":138239.60410300002,"text":"Since its founding by Asensio in 1537, Paraguay has largely succeeded in establishing its indigenous identity and character."},{"kind":"audio","t":138360.366504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138365.526936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138370.822576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":138376.112606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138381.246048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138386.53017800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138391.873927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":138394.149588,"samples":19624,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":145533.252134,"text":"Hastalık domuzlar tarafından taşınır. Daha sonra sivrisinekler yoluyla insanlara geçer."},{"kind":"text","t":146000.416039,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs. It is later transmitted to humans via mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":146110.01183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146114.458625,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":146192.913187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146198.35984400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146202.785309,"samples":30464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":155770.47750900002,"text":"Çoğu modern araştırma teleskobu uygun atmosfer koşullarına sahip ücra bölgelerdeki devasa tesislerdir."},{"kind":"text","t":156406.451646,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are massive facilities in remote areas with suitable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":156521.904348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156527.294646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156532.44674800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156537.583721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":156542.977389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156548.400716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":156548.68105100002,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":163235.135134,"text":"İnsanlar ülkeye dönen yolculara karşı sabırlı ve anlayışlı olmaları gerektiğini öngöremeyebilir."},{"kind":"text","t":164005.52250000002,"text":"People may not foresee that they need to be patient and understanding toward passengers returning to the country."},{"kind":"audio","t":164112.87971900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164118.11181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164123.244373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164128.69758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164133.98346000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164136.231361,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":170514.98667,"text":"Dolayısıyla bilgilendirmenin basit bir şekilde bir etiket olarak eklenmesi muhtemeldir."},{"kind":"text","t":171195.585966,"text":"Therefore, it is likely that the information will be added simply as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":171302.25585800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171307.452449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171312.755469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":171318.53595000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":171318.85430500002,"samples":4528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":176269.389743,"text":"Fakat kuşlar hakkında hala dinozor gibi görünen pek çok şey vardır."},{"kind":"text","t":176944.67602,"text":"But there are still many things about birds that look like dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":177104.576024,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177106.466912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":177108.362889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177108.80778200002,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":184443.218207,"text":"Neredeyse tamamı güvenle yüzülebilen kulunlu plajlardır."},{"kind":"text","t":184996.828199,"text":"Almost all of them are designated beaches where one can swim safely."},{"kind":"audio","t":185101.311457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185106.26345300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185111.360376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185116.947641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":185117.215536,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":189800.39244300002,"text":"Ve çoğunda Puhutu Kava ağacı tarafından sağlanan gölgelikler vardır."},{"kind":"text","t":190492.749109,"text":"And most of them have canopies provided by the Puhutu Kava tree."},{"kind":"audio","t":190593.767727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":190599.16917500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190604.392335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190607.730109,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":200803.803346,"text":"İki yetişkin çocukla evli olan Duval, hikayenin ilişkili olduğu Miller üzerinde büyük bir intiba bırakmadı."},{"kind":"text","t":201881.78832700002,"text":"Duval, who is married with two adult children, left little impression on Miller, who is associated with the story."},{"kind":"audio","t":202064.217687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202065.84961900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202067.169547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202068.72149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":202070.358012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202071.97659500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":202072.293339,"samples":2592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":212105.344296,"code":1005}]}